=== CTRL-2: CORPUS COMPLETENESS CAVEAT ===

This gap assessment is scoped to KN-LIT-3907, KN-LIT-056, and KN-LIT-8ce0b5. Does not
claim to survey all published formal proofs of hedged ML-DSA signing security.

=== CTRL-3: SCHEME VS IMPLEMENTATION BOUNDARY ===

The Jendral attack's 0.582 success rate is a hardware fault injection success rate on
Cortex-M4. This is implementation-level (depends on physical device, glitch parameters,
PCB, power supply). The formal proof coverage question (whether the scheme is provably
secure against nonce-erasure adversaries) is a separate scheme-level question. A scheme
could have a formal proof against nonce-erasure adversaries while still being
implementable insecurely on specific hardware.

